      <span class="eyebrow">Track finder</span>
      <h3>Need a starting suggestion?</h3>
      <p class="muted">Three questions. A suggested track. Your employer or programme admin still assigns what you take.</p>
      <div class="steps-dots" id="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="bubble" id="fBubble" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="opts" id="fOpts"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- TRUST -->
<section id="trust"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal"><div class="l"><span class="eyebrow">Trust, shown not claimed</span><h2>Real guidance. Real review.</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:400px">Nana Nova holds the standard. Dot Dot walks with every learner. We show culture — never fake placement stats.</p></div>
  <div class="trust-hero reveal">
    <img src="{{{assets}}}/trust-duo.webp" alt="Nana Nova and Dot Dot reviewing a holographic learning dashboard together">
    <div class="trust-hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Meet your guides</span>
      <h3>Expert craft. Eager learning.</h3>
      <p class="muted"><b>Nana Nova</b> is the expert with the glowing staff — rubrics, change notes, honest finish lines. <b>Dot Dot</b> is eager to learn — tips, progress, the next quest.</p>
      <div class="hero-cast">
        <span class="cast"><img src="{{{assets}}}/prof.webp" alt=""><b>Nana Nova</b><small>Expert · Mentor voice</small></span>
        <span class="cast"><img src="{{{assets}}}/bot.webp" alt=""><b>Dot Dot</b><small>Companion · Learner energy</small></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-grid">
    <button class="tcard reveal" aria-expanded="false"><img src="{{{assets}}}/employer-trust.webp" alt="Employees learning with Nana Nova in a workplace"><span class="lab">EMPLOYER</span><span class="txt"><b>Team upskilling</b>Assigned courses that stick<span class="more">Managers see phase progress. Employees get change notes they can apply before the next gate.</span></span></button>
    <button class="tcard reveal" aria-expanded="false"><img src="{{{assets}}}/mentor-review.webp" alt="Nana Nova mentoring a learner while Dot Dot watches"><span class="lab">MENTOR</span><span class="txt"><b>Review that teaches</b>Rubric + written notes<span class="more">Nana Nova’s model: score the evidence, name one concrete next step, reopen when needed.</span></span></button>
    <button class="tcard reveal" aria-expanded="false"><img src="{{{assets}}}/fellowship-bridge.webp" alt="Fellowship demo moment with Nana Nova and Dot Dot"><span class="lab">FELLOWSHIP</span><span class="txt"><b>Campus to craft</b>Defend artifacts, not slides<span class="more">The fellowship ends with demo day — tradeoffs challenged in the room, Dot Dot cheering every attempt.</span></span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Our commitments">
    <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-note="You only see courses your cohort or employer assigns — there is no open shop to scroll.">Assigned courses only</button>
    <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-note="A certificate is issued only after published criteria are met and issuing is confirmed.">Certificate when ready</button>
    <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-note="Structured learning for teams and fellows. No job, placement or income is promised.">Jobs never implied</button>
    <button class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-note="Cohorts share calendars and announcements. No public rankings or leaderboards.">Cohort visibility</button>
  </div>
  <p class="chip-note" id="chipNote" aria-live="polite"></p>
</div></section>

<!-- JOURNEY -->
<section id="journey" class="journey"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="journey-head reveal">
    <div class="journey-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">The spine</span>
      <h2>Four gates. One <span class="journey-em">honest arc.</span></h2>
      <p class="muted">Every track runs the same sequence. A gate unlocks only after the previous one passes at 70/100.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="journey-arc" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="journey-arc-line" viewBox="0 0 520 120" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M28 92 C 120 18, 200 18, 260 58 S 400 108, 492 42" stroke="url(#arcGrad)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="6 8"/>
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="arcGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="520" y2="0" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <stop stop-color="#1A61F2"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#7B6CF6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2E9E4F"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
      </svg>
      <ol class="journey-arc-nodes">
        <li class="jan g-blue"><span class="jan-cube"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:book-open-01" width="22" height="22"></iconify-icon></span><b>01</b><span>Foundations</span></li>
        <li class="jan g-sky"><span class="jan-cube"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:task-01" width="22" height="22"></iconify-icon></span><b>02</b><span>Guided Project</span></li>
        <li class="jan g-violet"><span class="jan-cube"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:cube" width="22" height="22"></iconify-icon></span><b>03</b><span>Simulation</span></li>
        <li class="jan g-green"><span class="jan-cube"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:flag-02" width="22" height="22"></iconify-icon></span><b>04</b><span>Demo Day</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="jgrid">
    <div class="gate-rail" role="tablist" aria-label="Learning phases" id="gates"></div>
    <div class="gate-detail reveal">
      <div class="gate-detail-body">
        <div class="gate-detail-top">
          <span class="eyebrow" id="jCount">Gate 1 of 4</span>
          <div class="gate-ring" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="64" height="64">
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27" class="gate-ring-track"/>
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="27" class="gate-ring-val" id="jRing" pathLength="100"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="gate-ring-label"><strong id="jWeightPct">20%</strong><small>of arc</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 id="jTitle">Foundations</h3>
        <p class="muted gate-summary" id="jSummary">Skill lessons that unlock the next gate.</p>
        <div class="gate-meta">
          <div>
            <span class="gate-meta-ico" aria-hidden="true"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:file-01" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon></span>
            <span class="muted">You submit</span>
            <b id="jSubmit">—</b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="gate-meta-ico" aria-hidden="true"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:square-unlock-02" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon></span>
            <span class="muted">Unlock rule</span>
            <b id="jUnlock">—</b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="gate-meta-ico" aria-hidden="true"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:chart-histogram" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon></span>
            <span class="muted">Pass bar</span>
            <b>70 / 100</b>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="gate-say" id="jBubble" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="spine-row">
          <div class="spine" aria-hidden="true"><i id="spine"></i></div>
          <span class="spine-pct" id="jPct">20% Complete</span>
        </div>
        <div class="jctrl">
          <button type="button" class="btn light" id="jPrev"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:arrow-left-02" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon> Back</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn primary" id="jNext">Next gate <iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:arrow-right-02" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

