          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wpanel" id="p-feedback">
          <div class="dash-head">
            <div>
              <h3>Mentor feedback</h3>
              <p class="muted">Sample learner view after sign-in. Rubric scores + one written change note. Attempts stay on record.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="chip">Gate 1 · Foundations</span>
          </div>

          <div class="fb-meta">
            <div><span class="muted">Submission</span><b>Evidence brief</b></div>
            <div><span class="muted">Attempt</span><b>1 of open</b></div>
            <div><span class="muted">Status</span><b class="fb-status-warn">Changes requested</b></div>
            <div><span class="muted">Next unlock</span><b>Guided project after 70+</b></div>
          </div>

          <div class="fb-card">
            <div class="fb-top">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Released review</span>
                <h3>Foundations · Evidence brief</h3>
                <p class="muted" style="font-size:13.5px;margin-top:4px">Product Management · same rubric for employer &amp; fellowship</p>
              </div>
              <span class="verdict no">Below 70</span>
            </div>

            <div class="fb-scores fb-scores-bars">
              <div>
                <div class="fb-score-row"><span>Evidence / framing</span><b>18/30</b></div>
                <div class="fb-bar"><i style="width:60%"></i></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fb-score-row"><span>Acceptance coverage</span><b>15/25</b></div>
                <div class="fb-bar"><i style="width:60%"></i></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fb-score-row"><span>Prioritisation / tradeoffs</span><b>16/25</b></div>
                <div class="fb-bar"><i style="width:64%"></i></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fb-score-row"><span>Communication / test plan</span><b>12/20</b></div>
                <div class="fb-bar"><i style="width:60%"></i></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="fb-total">
              <div><span>Total</span><b>61 / 100</b></div>
              <span class="muted">Pass bar 70 — gate stays closed until criteria met</span>
            </div>

            <div class="fb-note">
              <span class="eyebrow">Change note (required before resubmit)</span>
              <p><b>Change:</b> Name one assumption you cannot yet evidence, and add a source or interview note.</p>
              <p><b>Keep:</b> Clear problem statement — do not rewrite that section.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="fb-actions">
              <span class="btn primary" style="pointer-events:none">Resubmit attempt 2</span>
              <span class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Earlier attempt 1 stays visible to you and your mentor.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="fb-history">
            <span class="eyebrow">Attempt record</span>
            <div class="fb-hist-row">
              <span class="pn">01</span>
              <div><b>Attempt 1 · Evidence brief</b><small>Scored 61/100 · changes requested</small></div>
              <span class="pst">Released</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fb-hist-row muted-row">
              <span class="pn">02</span>
              <div><b>Attempt 2</b><small>Opens after you resubmit</small></div>
              <span class="pst">—</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wpanel" id="p-portfolio">
          <div class="dash-head">
            <div><h3>Portfolio</h3><p class="muted">Artifacts a reviewer can open without buying tools.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="port-grid">
            <div class="port-item"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:file-01" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon><div><b>Evidence brief</b><small>Foundations · draft</small></div><span class="pst">Saved</span></div>
            <div class="port-item"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:folder-01" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon><div><b>Capstone pack</b><small>Not started</small></div><span class="pst">—</span></div>
            <div class="port-item"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:note-01" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon><div><b>Change log</b><small>Simulation · locked</small></div><span class="pst">Locked</span></div>
            <div class="port-item"><iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:certificate-01" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon><div><b>Certificate</b><small>Issued when criteria met</small></div><span class="pst">Pending</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<!-- MENTORS / FEEDBACK MODEL -->
<section id="mentors" class="mentors" aria-labelledby="mentorsTitle">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="l">
        <span class="eyebrow">Feedback model</span>
        <h2 id="mentorsTitle">How mentor review actually works.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted mentors-lead">A released review always includes rubric scores, a pass/fail against 70, and one written change note. Attempts stay on record; nothing is silently overwritten.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mentor-grid">
      <div class="mentor-visual reveal">
        <img src="{{{assets}}}/mentor-review.webp" alt="Mentor reviewing learner evidence against a published rubric" width="720" height="540" decoding="async">
        <div class="mentor-badge">
          <iconify-icon icon="hugeicons:note-01" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"></iconify-icon>
          <div><b>Released review</b><small>Scores + change note + attempt history</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="rubric" id="rubric">
          <div class="rubric-head">
            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">Live sample · Product Management · Gate 1</span>
              <h3 class="rubric-title">Foundations · Evidence brief</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="chip">Pass bar 70 / 100</span>
          </div>
          <p class="rubric-lead muted">Drag each criterion the way a mentor scores. Total and pass/fail update live against the 70 bar.</p>

          <div id="crits" class="rubric-crits"></div>

          <div class="total">
            <div>
              <span class="muted" style="display:block;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:2px">Total</span>
              <span><b id="tot">60</b><span class="muted"> / 100</span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="verdict no" id="verdict">Below 70</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BECOME A MENTOR -->
